## The look, cloth: the Python Bpy.xtl writes for a banner
## (LookPieces.xtl) -- a pole, a flag that is a sheet of 12 by 8 squares
## worked out as arrays, painted with a weave, pinned along the pole and
## simulated in a wind, kept as the clip wave (2 s, 8 shapes), the export
## and the file read back -- pinned.

"lk:" u_se< "LookPieces"

"the banner:"
lk:banner c_at lk:f_ile "look-banner"
